      "description": "The intermediate representation includes a proposition about a benefit over a certain limit (E11), but the condition status explicitly states this is unknown. The scenario does not establish whether the donation provides a benefit to the donor over a certain limit, so this fact is missing, and its omission in the intermediate representation is a failure to represent the actual evidence.",
